{# Adventurers Guild: this actor's standing with the Guild. Rendered for the actor's own bio and, via "dialogue_target", for
   whoever they are speaking with. A liaison (the innkeeper who keeps a hold capital's Guild counter) also knows the
   counter's business and reads the player's page of the ledger. The Guild's lore lives in
   knowledge/adventurers_guild_lore.sknpack; the rules in guidelines/0511.
   Native decorators only (1.5.2): AdventurersGuild.dll keeps an NPC's standing in factions on the actors near the player,
   and the player's side in AdventurersGuild/SkyrimNet/state.json (SkyrimNetData.h in the mod's source has the layout):
     AG_SkyrimNetStandingFaction  0..5 member at rank letters[n], 10..15 retired at letters[n - 10]
     AG_SkyrimNetNoteFaction      the actor's own bio line, notes[n]
     AG_SkyrimNetPartyFaction     0..4 an active member of party, at Bond tier bondWords[n]; 10 + n former member of parties[n] #}
{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "dialogue_target" %}
{% if json_file_exists("AdventurersGuild/SkyrimNet/state") %}
    {% set ags = read_json("AdventurersGuild/SkyrimNet/state") %}
    {% if is_player(actorUUID) %}
        {% if ags.ledger.registered %}
        - Adventurers Guild: {{ ags.ledger.rank }}-rank adventurer (background; mention only when it is relevant)
        {% endif %}
        {# The player's party is only common knowledge once it has a reputation (renown >= 1); its own members and the
           Guild reps (below) always know it. #}
        {% if ags.party.party and ags.party.renown >= 1 %}
        - Leads the adventuring party {{ ags.party.name }}, together with {{ ags.party.membersText }}; the party is {{ ags.party.renownWord }}{% if ags.party.dungeons > 0 %}, with {{ ags.party.dungeons }} dungeons cleared together{% endif %}{% if ags.party.greatBeasts > 0 %} and {{ ags.party.greatBeasts }} great beasts slain{% endif %}{% if ags.party.fallenText != "" %}; they have lost {{ ags.party.fallenText }}{% endif %}
        {% endif %}
    {% else %}
        {% set agStanding = get_faction_rank(actorUUID, "AG_SkyrimNetStandingFaction") %}
        {% if agStanding >= 0 and agStanding <= 5 %}
        - Adventurers Guild: {{ at(ags.letters, agStanding) }}-rank adventurer (background; mention only when it is relevant)
        {% elif agStanding >= 10 and agStanding <= 15 %}
        - Adventurers Guild: retired {{ at(ags.letters, agStanding - 10) }}-rank adventurer, set aside under the Guild's Neutrality Oath when they took up another service; still quietly proud of the old rank (background; mention only when it is relevant)
        {% endif %}
        {% set agNote = get_faction_rank(actorUUID, "AG_SkyrimNetNoteFaction") %}
        {% if agNote >= 0 and agNote < length(ags.notes) %}
        - {{ at(ags.notes, agNote) }}
        {% endif %}
        {% set agTie = get_faction_rank(actorUUID, "AG_SkyrimNetPartyFaction") %}
        {% if agTie >= 0 and agTie <= 4 and ags.party.party %}
        - A sworn member of {{ player.name }}'s adventuring party, {{ ags.party.name }} (its members: {{ ags.party.membersText }}); their bond with {{ player.name }} is {{ at(ags.party.bondWords, agTie) }}. Proud of the party and its name (background; mention only when it is relevant)
        {% elif agTie >= 10 and agTie - 10 < length(ags.party.parties) %}
        - Once travelled with {{ player.name }} in the adventuring party {{ at(ags.party.parties, agTie - 10) }}
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
    {% if get_faction_rank(actorUUID, "AG_GuildLiaisonFaction") >= 0 %}
        {# the duties in full, and why the ranks are thin: knowledge pack entries ag_liaison_duties, ag_dwindling, ag_ledgers #}
        - Keeps this hold's Adventurers Guild counter as its licensed liaison: registration, trophies, reports, the Guild's services and cases for promotion
        {% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" %}
        - Knows the Guild's record of {{ player.name }} below, but raises it only when {{ player.name }} brings Guild business or asks about it; never brings it up unprompted while serving drinks or chatting
            {% set led = ags.ledger %}
            {% if led.registered %}
        - The Guild's record of {{ player.name }}: {{ led.rank }}-rank adventurer, {{ led.reputation }} Reputation, {{ led.merit }} Merit to spend{% if led.promotionReady %}; eligible for promotion to {{ led.next.rank }}-rank and only needs to ask here and pay the {{ led.promotionFee }} gold promotion fee{% else %}{% if led.next %}; {{ led.next.rank }}-rank needs {{ led.next.reputationShort }} more Reputation{% if led.next.levelShort > 0 %} and more seasoning in the field{% endif %}{% else %}; the highest rank the Guild grants{% endif %}{% endif %}
        - {{ player.name }}'s Appraisal: {% if led.appraisal == "none" %}not learned (they cannot read ranks at all; the first level is sold here for Merit){% else %}level {{ led.appraisal }} of III{% endif %}
        - Does all of {{ player.name }}'s Guild business (jobs, missives, reports, trophies, services, the guild card) at the counter: when {{ player.name }} brings Adventurers Guild business, opens the counter for them with the AG_OpenGuildCounter action
            {% set lp = ags.party %}
            {% if lp.party %}
        - {{ player.name }} leads the adventuring party {{ lp.name }}, registered with the Adventurers Guild: {{ lp.membersText }}; their bond is {{ lp.bondTier }}, {{ lp.days }} days on the road together, {{ lp.dungeons }} dungeons and {{ lp.missives }} missives; the party is {{ lp.renownWord }}{% if lp.fallenText != "" %}; lost: {{ lp.fallenText }}{% endif %}
            {% endif %}
                {% if led.hasCard == false %}
        - {{ player.name }} no longer carries their guild card: a replacement costs exactly {{ led.cardFee }} gold (never quote any other amount); when they ask for one and agree to the fee, hands it over with the AG_ReplaceGuildCard action
                {% endif %}
                {% if led.reportsWaiting.count > 0 %}
        - {{ player.name }} has {{ led.reportsWaiting.count }} finished job(s) not yet reported to the Guild, worth {{ led.reportsWaiting.gold }} gold, {{ led.reportsWaiting.merit }} Merit and {{ led.reportsWaiting.reputation }} Reputation when handed in at a counter
                {% endif %}
                {% if led.bounty and led.bounty.total > 0 %}
        - {{ player.name }} has a price on their head ({{ led.bounty.where }}); while it stands the Guild hears no case for their promotion. This counter can pay off all of it for {{ led.bounty.payTotal }} gold, the Guild's fee included, when {{ player.name }} asks
                {% endif %}
                {% if led.board and led.board.due %}
        - New work is waiting to go up on this town's missive board: {{ player.name }} should go and look at it
                {% endif %}
                {% if led.trophiesCarried.kinds > 0 %}
        - {{ player.name }} carries monster trophies the Guild would buy, worth about {{ led.trophiesCarried.merit }} Merit
                {% endif %}
            {% else %}
        - {{ player.name }} is not registered with the Adventurers Guild; registration can be done at this counter for a fee of exactly {{ led.registrationFee }} gold (never quote any other amount)
            {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
